ems will help you move faster and some will save you from a crash. Let's get the game FREE and enjoy your adventure with cute animals.", "short_description": "\"To Go Or Not To Go, that's a question.\"-- by ChickenLet Put on your GearVR and welcome to the virtual world of <Chicken GO> developed by HashVR Game Studio. We need you to help the Chicken cross the busy roads and raging rivers. Pay attention the zombies and driftwoods, and the GOLDEN COINS of couse. Some items will help you move faster and some will save you from a crash. Let's get the game FREE and enjoy your adventure with cute animals."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.hashvr.com/?page_id=178", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.hashvr.com/?page_id=448", "publisher_name": "HashVR Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.hashvr.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["CASUAL", "ARCADE", "ADVENTURE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "en_US"], "supported_input_devices": [], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1278772629312697"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1283159965104152", "version": "1.1"}, "id": "1020749248024534", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Applica